WEBVTT

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Interviewer>Describe your caching implementation.</v>

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Candidate>I added Redis caching for product lookups with a 60-second TTL.</v>

